# =============================================================================
# .env.example — template for environment variables
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in real values. NEVER commit the real `.env`
# (it is already in .gitignore). When you add a new secret here, also add it in
# the Trigger.dev dashboard → your project → Environment Variables (staging AND
# prod), or production runs will fail.
# =============================================================================

# Example — delete or replace once you build your first automation:
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...        # from https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# SLACK_BOT_TOKEN=xoxb-...     # from https://api.slack.com/apps
